o  demonstrate to you here is that this is  how we give the control of the customer  they control the access they control who  uses that they control which services  are being used and so all of that  control is placed in the hands of the  customers we do have a customer support  organization that will help you out if  you run into trouble with that but you  are using these resources and  controlling them yourselves let's let's  talk about governments and this you know  this becomes very interesting in that I  don't know if it really applies as much  to the median entertainment industry as  it does some of the other industries but  we always have customers that are  concerned about about governments  getting access to data that's stored in  our cloud and so a couple things about  that one is you may or may not be aware  but Google was the first to publish what  we call a government transparency report  and so we are we are publishing  information about all the information  requests we get from the US federal  government and other governments around  the world we in in our Terms of Service  or in our agreements with the customers  our customers are responsible for  dealing with government requests and and  and it's and it's our policy to make  sure that whoever is making that request  really understands that really  interfaces with the customer and in the  situations where that doesn't happen in  we can't do that unless we're compelled  by law it's also our policy to make sure  that the customer is aware that that  activity is going on and and we've we  push we push we push back on that to  make sure that it's that it's very  appropriately legal when those types of  things do happen  we're also Safe Harbor certified and  what that means is that that enables us  to comply with European privacy law and  that's we can we can present that to our  European customers so that they  understand that and gives us you know  legal legal standing and you don't have  to just take 